\n```\n2331 | def refine(self, assumptions=True):\n2332 |         \"\"\"Apply refine to each element of the matrix.\n2333 | \n2334 |         Examples\n2335 |         ========\n2336 | \n2337 |         >>> from sympy import Symbol, Matrix, Abs, sqrt, Q\n2338 |         >>> x = Symbol('x')\n2339 |         >>> Matrix([[Abs(x)**2, sqrt(x**2)],[sqrt(x**2), Abs(x)**2]])\n2340 |         Matrix([\n2341 |         [ Abs(x)**2, sqrt(x**2)],\n2342 |         [sqrt(x**2),  Abs(x)**2]])\n2343 |         >>> _.refine(Q.real(x))\n2344 |         Matrix([\n2345 |         [  x**2, Abs(x)],\n2346 |         [Abs(x),   x**2]])\n2347 | \n2348 |         \"\"\"\n2349 |         return self.applyfunc(lambda x: refine(x, assumptions))\n```\n"}, {"content": "Let me also check the execution trace for more specific patterns:\n\n<function=get_trace_artifacts>\n<parameter=path_contains>rewrite.py</parameter>\n<parameter=name_contains>rewrite</parameter>\n", "role": "assistant", "tool_calls": null, "function_call": null}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "toolu_01", "name": "get_trace_artifacts", "content": "OBSERVATION:\n{\n  \"instance_id\": \"sympy__sympy-27325\",\n  \"trace_summary\": {\n    \"unique_function_count\": 120,\n    \"returned_count\": 0,\n    \"filtered_count\": 0\n  },\n  \"applied_filters\": {\n    \"artifact_type\": \"all\",\n    \"path_contains\": \"rewrite.py\",\n    \"name_contains\": \"rewrite\",\n    \"start\": 0,\n    \"limit\": 8\n  },\n  \"artifacts\": [],\n  \"has_more\": false,\n  \"next_start\": 0\n}"}, {"content": "Let me check the dependencies around the rewrite functionality:\n\n<function=get_trace_data_dependencies>\n<parameter=edge_type>data</parameter>\n<parameter=path_contains>basic.py</parameter>\n<parameter=edge_type>ret</parameter>\n", "role": "assistant", "tool_calls": null, "function_call": null}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "toolu_01", "name": "get_trace_data_dependencies", "content": "OBSERVATION:\n{\n  \"instance_id\": \"sympy__sympy-27325\",\n  \"dep_s