n decimal_formatter(0.0)\n1317 |             else:\n1318 |                 return self.na_rep\n1319 | \n1320 |         return formatter\n```\n\nFound function `pandas/io/formats/format.py:FloatArrayFormatter._format_strings`.\nSource: Retrieved code content using keyword search (bm25).\n```\n1452 | def _format_strings(self) -> list[str]:\n1453 |         return list(self.get_result_as_array())\n```\n"}, {"content": "Let me also check for any dependencies on float_format in the CSV rendering process:\n\n<function=get_trace_data_dependencies>\n<parameter=symbol_contains>['CSVFormatter', 'float_format']</parameter>\n<parameter=edge_type>['arg', 'data']</parameter>\n", "role": "assistant", "tool_calls": null, "function_call": null}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "toolu_01", "name": "get_trace_data_dependencies", "content": "OBSERVATION:\n{\n  \"instance_id\": \"pandas-dev__pandas-60457\",\n  \"dep_summary\": {\n    \"retained_file_count\": 9,\n    \"retained_symbol_count\": 135,\n    \"retained_edge_count\": 120,\n    \"returned_edge_count\": 0,\n    \"filtered_edge_count\": 0\n  },\n  \"applied_filters\": {\n    \"symbol_contains\": \"['CSVFormatter', 'float_format']\",\n    \"scope_contains\": null,\n    \"path_contains\": null,\n    \"edge_type\": \"['arg', 'data']\",\n    \"start\": 0,\n    \"limit\": 12,\n    \"path_limit\": 4\n  },\n  \"matched_symbols\": [],\n  \"edges\": [],\n  \"paths\": [],\n  \"has_more\": false,\n  \"next_start\": 0\n}"}, {"content": "After thorough analysis of the codebase and dependencies, I can confirm that the previously identified locations are indeed comprehensive for addressing the documentation improvement issue. Here's why:\n\n1. Primary Implementation:\n   - `pandas/core/generic.py:NDFrame.to_csv` (line: 3767-3769): Main implementation where float_format is documented\n\n2. Formatter Implementation Chain:\n   - `pandas/io/formats/csvs.py:CSVFormatter._number_format` (line: 180-182): Where float_format is processed for CSV output\